For every weapon *created on the floor when the level is created*
there is a 5% chance of it being turned into an artifact.  Since there
are no artifact scimitars and so on the actual percentage of items
created when the level is created is far lower than 5%.

Weapons are also created in the initial inventories of monsters.
Only very specific ones are ever created as artifacts and those
are very few and far between (some As, some purple Ls, a
player monster in Astral).  Since so many monsters get weapons
and players often kill so many monsters the percentage seems
to end up even lower still.

I don't know if death drops that are weapons have a chance of
ending up artifacts.



